# Research intermediate outputs — only reports (*.md), scripts (*.py), manifests
# (*.yaml/*.yml/*.json) and conclusion texts (*.txt) belong in git. Generated
# data tables, figures, and logs are never committed regardless of subdir layout.
research/**/data/
research/**/figures/
research/**/assets/
research/**/*.png
research/**/*.jpg
research/**/*.jpeg
research/**/*.pdf
research/**/*.svg
research/**/*.csv
research/**/*.tsv
research/**/*.bed
research/**/*.vcf
research/**/*.vcf.gz
research/**/*.bam
research/**/*.bai
research/**/*.gz
research/**/*.log
research/**/*.txt
research/**/*.nwk

# Pipeline working dirs — heavy intermediate artifacts (added 2026-05-19)
# Use dir/** (not dir/) so !exception below can re-include .md/.py/.json
research/**/intermediate/**
research/**/work/**
research/**/_work/**
research/**/runs/**
research/**/output/**
research/**/outputs/**
research/**/tmp/**
research/**/_tmp/**
research/**/cache/**
# Pipeline-specific output dirs (added 2026-05-19, revised 2026-05-20)
# ⚠ Git limitation: "dir/**" 等同 dir excluded — !exception 無法救回內部 .md/.py/.json
# 修正: 只保留「整 tree 全 output」的 dir; 其他依賴既有 generic regex (data/, figures/, *.csv 等)
research/paired_priority_bug_audit/phaseC_*_with_significance/**
# 移除 over-broad rules (內含 source files 被誤 ignored, 共 30+ files):
#   cycle*/** (cycle1-3 內含 cycle*_findings.md / 00_PLAN.md / *.json)
#   reports/** / v6_bam_tpfp_hp_loh_cn/** (內含 00_PLAN / 01-02_*.md)
#   v6_per_chr_alt_work/** (已被下方 *.txt override 處理)
# Override !*.txt exception for specific per-chr calculation outputs (added 2026-05-20)
# v6_per_chr_alt_work/*.txt 是 per-chr alt ratio 計算 output 不是 conclusion text
research/paired_priority_bug_audit/v6_per_chr_alt_work/*.txt
# Heavy binary data formats (added 2026-05-19) — numpy / parquet / HDF5 / Python serialized
research/**/*.npy
research/**/*.npz
research/**/*.parquet
research/**/*.pkl
research/**/*.feather
research/**/*.h5
research/**/*.hdf5
research/**/*.zarr
# Genomic raw formats (added 2026-05-19) — fasta / fastq / cram
research/**/*.fasta
research/**/*.fa
research/**/*.fai
research/**/*.fastq
research/**/*.fq
research/**/*.fastq.gz
research/**/*.fq.gz
research/**/*.cram
research/**/*.crai

